WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.146
The headline result is a night-and-day improvement.

00:00:03.226 --> 00:00:05.550
As the number of injected nodes grows,

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:09.282
the sample-wise baseline collapses to zero
certified nodes,

00:00:09.362 --> 00:00:12.191
while the collective certificates hold strong.

00:00:12.271 --> 00:00:15.481
On Citeseer with a hundred and forty injected nodes,

00:00:15.561 --> 00:00:20.857
the standard collective relaxation certifies
seventy-three percent of targets and the

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:24.400
customized version reaches eighty-one point two percent,

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.056
both against zero percent for sample-wise.

00:00:27.136 --> 00:00:32.117
The customized Collective-LP-two consistently
matches or beats the standard one,

00:00:32.197 --> 00:00:37.114
in one setting by over two hundred percent
relative, and it does so far faster,

00:00:37.194 --> 00:00:40.340
solving even the largest budgets in about a minute.
